nd pump_until it reports is_reconfigured() == Some and its decided index is at least the leader's, emitting case_result_reconfig_recovered.\\\",\n    \\\"semantic_changes\\\": [\n      \\\"No production logic is replaced or patched; the case uses only public API calls (reconfigure, is_reconfigured, append, get_decided_idx).\\\"\n    ],\n    \\\"responsibility\\\": \\\"Under test is the current configuration's stopping protocol and the propagation of the decided StopSign to a participant that was absent while it was reached, i.e. the participants' transition out of eligibility and the obligation to complete the reconfiguration for a returning participant.\\\",\n    \\\"previous_id\\\": \\\"39f7d4c4c0484f7e94edbc51cbd78c2b-experiment\\\",\n    \\\"revision_reason\\\": \\\"Reconfiguration case added to the same cluster harness to cover the authority-transition axis (StopSign decision with one participant down, rejection of further proposals, and propagation to the recovered participant). The previously declared cases remain in the harness and in the fixed artifact; their comparisons were evaluated in the preceding revision.\\\",\n    \\\"prerequisites\\\": [\n      {\\\"alias\\\": \\\"reconfig_admitted\\\", \\\"event\\\": \\\"reconfig_admitted\\\", \\\"conditions\\\": [{\\\"field\\\": \\\"case\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": \\\"stopsign_reconfiguration\\\"}, {\\\"field\\\": \\\"prefix_len\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": 4}]}\n    ],\n    \\\"comparisons\\\": [\n      {\\\"event\\\": \\\"case_result_reconfig_live\\\", \\\"identity_fields\\\": [\\\"case\\\"], \\\"admission_alias\\\": \\\"reconfig_admitted\\\", \\\"assertion\\\": {\\\"field\\\": \\\"live_participants_stopped\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": true}, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Both live participants report the decided StopSign once the leader has proposed the next configuration.\\\"},\n      {\\\"event\\\": \\\"case_result_reconfig_live\\\", \\\"identity_fields\\\": [\\\"case\\\"], \\\"admission_alias\\\": \\\"reconfig_admitted\\\", \\\"assertion\\\": {\\\"field\\\": \\\"append_after_stopsign_rejected\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": true}, \\\"description\\\": \\\"A further proposal on the stopped configuration is rejected rather than accepted.\\\"},\n      {\\\"event\\\": \\\"case_result_reconfig_recovered\\\", \\\"identity_fields\\\": [\\\"case\\\"], \\\"admission_alias\\\": \\\"reconfig_admitted\\\", \\\"assertion\\\": {\\\"field\\\": \\\"recovered_participant_stopped\\\", \\\"op\\\": \\\"eq\\\", \\\"value\\\": true}, \\\"description\\\": \\\"The participant that was absent when the StopSign was decided learns it after recovery and catches up to the leader's decided index.\\\"}\n    ]\n  }\n}\nJSON\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-15_19-20-29-omnipaxos-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | head -3\"","aggregated_output":"{\"valid\": true, \"run_id\": \"a7af2b67959f4f6dbe7146d3ed9cbf8a\", \"elapsed_seconds\": 2173.072098417004, \"diagnostics\": [], \"meaning\": \"Read-only validation of these bytes and saved state; no acceptance, execution or budget reservation\", \"no_change\": false, \"execution_requested\": true, \"effects\": [{\"object\": \"experiments\", \"action\": \"create\", \"target\": \"experiment\"}]}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
